{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Bleached</strong></i> is a point-and-click interactive story about life and color. When every day looks the same, tints slowly fade. One day, your canvas is empty. Can you paint something new?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Recolor the world around you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your environment is turning white... and painting new shades isn't so simple. With time, perhaps new strokes can bring new perspectives.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/home.gif?t=1743368252\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Point and click on anything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk around, talk to friends and colleagues, take care of pets, play minigames. Everything in the scenery is interactive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/subway.gif?t=1743368252\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wake up. Work. Sleep. Repeat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each day is the exact same picture, except that your relationships\u2014with yourself and others\u2014evolve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/extras/work.gif?t=1743368252\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3589870?t=1743368252","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589870/804b1bca600cee8b9bca045949aaaddb3fc088a6/page_bg_